From 91c90a18f2fa2b99cc478568e35c9829e4918ca9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Naster17 <naster17.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:27:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan : add turbo5/6 and TQ get_rows shader support

Add TURBO5_0/TURBO6_0 dequant/get_rows/set_rows/cpy shader registrations
and Vulkan pipeline/support wiring. Add TQ3_1S/TQ4_1S get_rows pipelines
and GET_ROWS support. Extend FA and copy/dequant shader paths for
TURBO5_0/TURBO6_0.

Assisted-by: opencode
